# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore build and test binaries.
bin/
.git/
# Devtools-container Go module/build cache + envtest assets +
# kubeconfig. Grows to multiple GB during normal dev (3+ GB observed).
# Without this entry every `docker build` ships the entire cache as
# build context to the daemon — slow, expensive, and pointless (the
# Dockerfile multi-stage builder re-fetches modules inside the image).
.gocache/
